# Code-block tools CI installs before `cargo test`, checked with `sha256sum --strict -c` (comment
# lines stripped first). A mismatch fails the job. Each sum is the project's published one,
# cross-checked against a local download on 2026-11-04.
#
# shfmt v3.14.1
#   binary: https://github.com/mvdan/sh/releases/download/v3.14.1/shfmt_v3.14.1_linux_amd64
#   sum:    the release publishes no checksum file; this is the asset digest GitHub publishes
#           for it, https://api.github.com/repos/mvdan/sh/releases/tags/v3.14.1 (assets[].digest)
# ruff 0.17.3
#   tarball: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/releases/download/0.17.3/ruff-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
#   sum:     https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/releases/download/0.17.3/ruff-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256
#            (the same as GitHub's asset digest for it)
#
# shellcheck v0.11.0 (the latest release, which publishes a digest)
#   tarball: https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck/releases/download/v0.11.0/shellcheck-v0.11.0.linux.x86_64.tar.gz
#   sum:     the release publishes no checksum file; this is the asset digest GitHub publishes
#            for it, https://api.github.com/repos/koalaman/shellcheck/releases/tags/v0.11.0 (assets[].digest)
#
# biome 2.6.5
#   binary: https://github.com/biomejs/biome/releases/download/%40biomejs/biome%402.6.5/biome-linux-x64
#   sum:    the release publishes no checksum file; this is the asset digest GitHub publishes
#           for it, https://api.github.com/repos/biomejs/biome/releases/tags/@biomejs/biome@2.6.5 (assets[].digest)
#
# tombi v1.10.0 (the TOML tool; taplo publishes no checksum and is not used)
#   tarball: https://github.com/tombi-toml/tombi/releases/download/v1.10.0/tombi-cli-1.10.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz
#   sum:     the release publishes no checksum file; this is the asset digest GitHub publishes
#            for it, https://api.github.com/repos/tombi-toml/tombi/releases/tags/v1.10.0 (assets[].digest)
#
# yamlfmt v0.21.0
#   tarball: https://github.com/google/yamlfmt/releases/download/v0.21.0/yamlfmt_0.21.0_Linux_x86_64.tar.gz
#   sum:     the Linux_x86_64 line of https://github.com/google/yamlfmt/releases/download/v0.21.0/checksums.txt
#            (the same as GitHub's asset digest for it)
#
# rumdl v0.3.2
#   tarball: https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.2/rumdl-v0.3.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
#   sum:     https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.2/rumdl-v0.3.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256
#            (the same as GitHub's asset digest for it)
#
# Go 1.27.3 (gofmt and go vet; actions/setup-go does not verify toolchain checksums)
#   tarball: https://go.dev/dl/go1.27.3.linux-amd64.tar.gz
#   sum:     the sha256 for go1.27.3.linux-amd64.tar.gz in https://go.dev/dl/?mode=json
#
# yamllint is pinned with hashes in ci/requirements-yamllint.txt.
# black is pinned with hashes in ci/requirements-black.txt.
